# Netlify publishes the whole repo, so anything in it is a public URL unless
# listed here. The trailing ! is load-bearing: Netlify serves a matching
# static file before it consults redirect rules, and ! forces the rule to win.
#
# /news/data holds the sync script's per-article records -- the same text as
# the article pages, and a duplicate-content copy if crawled.
/CLAUDE.md          /404  404!
/scripts/*          /404  404!
/news/data/*        /404  404!
/.github/*          /404  404!
/tests/*            /404  404!

# Browsers request /favicon.ico regardless of the <link rel="icon"> tag.
/favicon.ico        /favicon.svg  200

# Consolidated into impact.html (2026-09-15): Why 25F and How It Works are now
# sections of the Impact page. Both old URLs were indexed and linked.
/why-25f.html          /impact.html#why-25f       301
/how-giving-works.html /impact.html#how-it-works  301
# Netlify served every page at its extensionless path too, so Google also
# knows these two without .html. Without these rules they 404.
/why-25f               /impact.html#why-25f       301
/how-giving-works      /impact.html#how-it-works  301

# Merged into team.html ("Our Team", 2026-09-29): Leadership's bios and the
# Contact page's form now share one page. The contact form sits at #contact.
# Both old URLs were indexed and are linked from outside the site.
/leadership.html  /team.html          301
/contact.html     /team.html#contact  301
/leadership       /team.html          301
/contact          /team.html#contact  301

# Netlify serves every page at its extensionless path with a 200, and that
# copy carries the same canonical tag as the .html page. Search Console showed
# Google picking /impact as canonical over the declared /impact.html and
# leaving the .html page unindexed. 301 each extensionless path to the .html
# URL the canonical tags and sitemap.xml name. Forced (!) because the
# extensionless path resolves to a file on disk, which would otherwise shadow
# the rule. scripts/sync_substack.py rebuilds the rules between the markers
# from the same list as sitemap.xml -- edit STATIC_PAGES there, not here.
# EXTENSIONLESS:START
/impact                                       /impact.html                                       301!
/platform                                     /platform.html                                     301!
/va-eistc                                     /va-eistc.html                                     301!
/team                                         /team.html                                         301!
/news                                         /news.html                                         301!
/donate                                       /donate.html                                       301!
/apply                                        /apply.html                                        301!
/families                                     /families.html                                     301!
/transparency                                 /transparency.html                                 301!
/privacy                                      /privacy.html                                      301!
/news/treasurys-proposed-federal-scholarship  /news/treasurys-proposed-federal-scholarship.html  301!
/news/is-your-state-in-follow-the-education   /news/is-your-state-in-follow-the-education.html   301!
/news/two-bills-that-could-make-state-opt     /news/two-bills-that-could-make-state-opt.html     301!
/news/what-sgos-should-be-doing-right-now     /news/what-sgos-should-be-doing-right-now.html     301!
